1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,700
1945. My dearest one, I have just heard the news that all the army men taken POW are to

2
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:13,300
return to their homes. Because of the shipping situation, we may not commence to go before

3
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:19,760
the end of February, but can probably count on being in England sometime in March. Maybe

4
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:29,920
sooner. It has made me very warm inside. It's terrific, it's wonderful, it's shattering.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
I cannot think. The delay is nothing. The decision is everything.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Now I am confirming in my head the little decisions I have made when contemplating just the possibility.

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,000
I must spend the first days at home. I must see Deb and her mother.

8
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
I must consider giving a party somewhere. Above all, I must be with you.

9
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,000
I must warm you, surround you, love you and be kind to you.

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Tell me anything that's in your...

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:11,840
mind, write tons and tons and tons and plan our time. I would prefer not to get married,

12
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:26,000
but want you to agree on the point. In the battle, I was afraid for you, for my mother,

13
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:29,840
I would love for myself. Wait, we must my love, my darling.

14
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:37,239
Let us meet, let us be, let us know, but do not let us now make any mistakes.

15
00:01:37,239 --> 00:01:42,299
I am anxious, very anxious, that you should not misunderstand what I have said.

16
00:01:42,299 --> 00:01:50,019
Say what you think, but please agree and remember I was afraid and I am still afraid.

17
00:01:50,019 --> 00:01:53,579
How good for us to see each other before I am completely bald!

18
00:01:53,579 --> 00:01:59,780
But if you find it, wisps of hair on the top of my head.

19
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,500
Not much good me trying to write about recent experiences now that I know I shall be able

20
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:08,180
to tell you everything myself within such a short time.

21
00:02:08,180 --> 00:02:12,460
What I have my eye on now is the first letter from you saying that you know I am all right,

22
00:02:12,460 --> 00:02:15,840
and then next saying you know I am coming to you.

23
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:19,939
Must try and keep out of hospital with some of these post-POW complaints.

24
00:02:19,939 --> 00:02:24,699
Plan a week somewhere, not Boscombe or Bournemouth, and think of being together.

25
00:02:24,699 --> 00:02:28,300
The glory of you.

26
00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:30,039
When I was captive I used to try and...

27
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:39,319
contact you and think hard. Bessie, my dearest, I'm all right. Do not worry. I never thought

28
00:02:39,319 --> 00:02:42,520
that I would get through somehow, but now it's over and you know that I'm all right

29
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:50,000
and going to be with you soon to join and enjoy. Do not get very excited outwardly.

30
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:54,879
I am conscious of the inner tumour, the clamour, but I am not too much outwardly joyful. Moderation

31
00:02:54,879 --> 00:02:57,479
is my advice. Watch the buses as you cross the streets.

32
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:05,319
We're free of duties and yesterday I went to our friends in Athens taking some of your

33
00:03:05,319 --> 00:03:08,020
coffee and cocoa which they were very pleased to have.

34
00:03:08,020 --> 00:03:09,719
Thank you for sending it.

35
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:15,319
We were embraced, very excitedly kissing and so on, continental fashion.

36
00:03:15,319 --> 00:03:24,699
I hope that you will not start buying any clothes if you have any coupons left because

37
00:03:24,699 --> 00:03:27,099
you think you must look nice for me.

38
00:03:27,099 --> 00:03:29,240
I shall be sorry if you do.

39
