61
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:35,560
on as near as possible to normal. My return at the present time allows us to make public

62
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:41,379
our mutual attachment. I shall tell my family that I hope to spend a week away with you

63
00:03:41,379 --> 00:03:49,180
somewhere during my leave. My counsel to you is to tell as few people as possible to someone

64
00:03:49,180 --> 00:03:53,139
like Miss Ferguson. You can politely reply to observations that you thought it was your

65
00:03:53,139 --> 00:03:59,960
business rather than hers. Try to avoid preening yourself and saying much. This is my advice

66
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:00,960
for you.

67
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:00,979
Thank you.

68
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:02,719
Not anything but that.

69
00:04:02,719 --> 00:04:05,520
I hope you understand.

70
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:09,520
I do not ever want it to be anything but our affair.

71
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:11,319
Do not permit any intrusion.

72
00:04:14,319 --> 00:04:17,079
I do not know how long leave I shall get.

73
00:04:17,079 --> 00:04:18,959
I could get as little as 14 days,

74
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:22,000
and I may get as much as a month.

75
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:25,240
I'm wondering how I shall tell you that I am in England.

76
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:26,500
Probably it will still be quicker

77
00:04:26,500 --> 00:04:28,079
to send a telegram than a letter,

78
00:04:28,079 --> 00:04:29,920
and I hope to send you one, announcing

79
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:33,819
I am on the same island. I will send another when I am actually soon to get on the London

80
00:04:33,819 --> 00:04:40,160
bound train and you can ring Lee Green 0509 when you think I have arrived there. You must

81
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:45,720
bear in mind that I shall be with my brother until we get home. Also that having been away

82
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:51,459
from home for so long my parents will want to see a lot of me. I hope that everything

83
00:04:51,459 --> 00:04:57,339
will work itself out without any unhappiness to anyone. I shall be in great demand from

84
00:04:57,339 --> 00:04:59,980
two or three points and it will be difficult to manage without a fence.

85
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:10,720
Strange thing, but I cannot seem to get going and write very freely.

86
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:16,600
All I'm thinking about is, I am going home, I'm going to see her.

87
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:23,759
It's a fact, a real thing, an impending event like Trove Tuesday, Christmas Day, and all

88
00:05:23,759 --> 00:05:25,680
the Lord Mayor's Banquet.

89
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:29,680
You have to be abroad, you have to be really, truly...

90
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:32,800
and it's been dramatically sealed off from your intimates,

91
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:37,800
from your home to realize what a gift this going home is.

92
00:05:40,939 --> 00:05:42,680
The few letters of yours that I had on me,

93
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:45,279
I burnt the day previous to our surrender,

94
00:05:45,279 --> 00:05:47,800
so no one but myself has read your words.

95
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:50,740
In the first 10 days of our captivity,

96
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:52,439
I did not think any soft thoughts about you.

97
00:05:52,439 --> 00:05:55,480
All I did was concentrate on trying to tell you

98
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,459
I was all right.

99
00:05:56,459 --> 00:06:00,060
But when we had a few supplies dropped by aircraft,

100
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:04,560
great risk to themselves in the misty snow-bound Greek mountain villages and we started hoping

101
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:10,560
we might get sent home upon our release. I was always wondering about you, about us.

102
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:17,199
It is a pity that the winter weather will not be kind to us out of doors, but it would

103
00:06:17,199 --> 00:06:21,680
be nice sitting next to you in the pictures no matter what may be on the screen. It would

104
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:25,120
be grand to know that we have each other's support and sympathy.

105
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:30,000
Wouldn't it be wonderful to be together, really together?

106
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:37,000
in the flesh, not just to know that a letter is all we can send.

107
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:40,000
I love you, Chris.

